msgstr "主要な規約"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/index.md:50
#: d357a6cc4d5e4c71bfa88bb97ab1ab34
msgid ""
"**Coupling Response**: $C(f) = Y_{\\text{count}}(f) / X_{\\text{m}}(f)$ with "
"physical unit $\\text{ct}/\\text{m}$."
msgstr ""
"**結合応答**: 物理単位 $\\text{ct}/\\text{m}$ を持つ結合応答関数 $C(f) = Y_{\\text{count}}(f) "
"/ X_{\\text{m}}(f)$。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/index.md:51
#: dd0932450ee34c53aa7aab0542913993
msgid ""
"**Complex Spectrum Calibration**: $X(f) = Y(f) / C(f)$ restoring physical "
"displacement in meters."
msgstr "**複素スペクトル校正**: 物理変位（メートル）を復元する $X(f) = Y(f) / C(f)$。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/index.md:52
#: ec769a8e9a1b4cffa30447faf6b928d8
msgid ""
"**Amplitude Spectral Density (ASD)**: $A_x(f) = A_y(f) / |C(f)|$ with unit "
"$\\text{m}/\\sqrt{\\text{Hz}}$."
msgstr ""
"**振幅スペクトル密度（ASD）**: 単位 $\\text{m}/\\sqrt{\\text{Hz}}$ を持つ振幅スペクトル密度 $A_x(f) = "
"A_y(f) / |C(f)|$。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/index.md:53
#: 2a8c632eefc0491496331b0d1c421e3b
#, python-brace-format
